sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as monitor.py<br/>(library server)
    participant V as VPN tunnel<br/>(encrypted)
    participant A as API<br/>(in Azure)
    participant D as Database<br/>(Azure SQL)
    M->>M: Measure CPU: 23.5%
    M->>V: Send measurement + API key
    V->>A: Deliver it safely to Azure
    A->>A: Right key? Correct data?
    alt Yes
        A->>D: Save the measurement
        D-->>A: Saved
        A-->>M: 201: stored
    else Wrong key
        A-->>M: 401: not allowed
    else Wrong data (for example 150%)
        A-->>M: 400: wrong data
    end
